{"ID":"20240220132617-ubt2epg","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240220132617-ubt2epg","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240220132617-ubt2epg\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312164454-hs8qya2\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312164504-pensuu9\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:699,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312164504-pensuu9\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:175,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:175\u0026#125;","title":"【黄芩汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20240312164504"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240312164454-hs8qya2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312164454-hs8qya2","updated":"20240312164454"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第一百八十七条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312164454-c61wvwj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312164454-c61wvwj","updated":"20240312164454"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：「太阳」与「少阳」合病,自下利者,与「黄芩汤」；若呕者。「黄芩加半夏生姜汤」主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240312164454-vps4td8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312164454-vps4td8","updated":"20240312164454"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"光是太阳有下痢的时候，我们会使用葛芩连汤，如果讲少阳太阳合病，意思是告诉你，这个病人是有下痢，但是兼有太阳症，恶风、有汗，身体肌肉酸痛，同时兼有往来寒热，恶心，我们知道这个病人太阳证兼有少阳症，又出现下痢，这个时候，最好选择是黄芩汤。纯太阳的下痢我们是葛芩连汤。"}]},{"ID":"20240312164454-v0umgrl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312164454-v0umgrl","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312164454"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"黄芩汤方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312164454-duovfx4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312164454-duovfx4","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312164454"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"黄芩三两，甘草二两炙，芍药二两，大枣十二枚劈。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312164454-1t2mhsx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312164454-1t2mhsx","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312164454"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右四味,以水一斗,煮取三升,去滓,温服一升,日再服,夜一服。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312164454-gsgr8y7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312164454-gsgr8y7","updated":"20240312164454"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"张仲景用到芍药，除了补阴不足，用到芍药就是有腹痛。芍药跟枳实，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"张仲景在有胸满的症状的时候，一定会加重枳实，有腹痛的时候，一定会重用芍药。如果弄错了，有胸满的时候，重用芍药，他会更满，胸会更胀。所以治疗心脏病几乎不用到白芍，胸满气喘用不到白芍。治疗肚子痛的时候，用不到枳实，但是在胸满的时候，一定会用到枳实。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312164454-jt76xez","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312164454-jt76xez","updated":"20240312164454"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"黄芩肠胃炎的时候一定会使用到，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"如果是在胃里面张仲景用大黄黄连，如果到了肠子里面去用黄芩。如果胃肠统统出问题，大黄、黄芩、黄连，三黄汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。如果问题出自肠子里面，下痢跟胃没有关系，下痢跟肠子有关系，所以他用黄芩，病人下痢的时候用炙甘草，因为炙甘草入小肠，小肠跟心脏是表里。所以当我们会用到甘草的时候，如果是生甘草大部分是在胃里，肠子里面用炙甘草，白芍能够去腹痛，去腹痛是因为腹部非常多的静脉在里面，白芍下去可以把静脉收起来，"}]},{"ID":"20240312164454-nqthd51","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312164454-nqthd51","updated":"20240312164454"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"还有就是下痢，白芍能够滋阴，同时可以在腹部肠子，肠壁上里面产生滋润的功能，芍药是滋阴的药，四物汤里面有芍药，实际上"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"芍药是止腹痛的，同时又可以滋阴的"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240312164454-y79yogm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312164454-y79yogm","updated":"20240312164454"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果你知道药性，同样是开四物汤，一般比例是二三三二，当归、芍药、川穹、熟地。月经痛，白芍一两，同样处方，但是白芍加重。一看岳母，要年轻点，生地加重点，生地滋补的药，加重，年轻美丽。但是四物汤是身体很健康的时候吃。平常没事吃点桂枝汤，把肌肉不舒服的地方解掉，那你身体常年是好的，可以吃补。"}]},{"ID":"20240312164454-c7sragl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312164454-c7sragl","updated":"20240312164454"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"恶心加下痢，同样的黄芩加半夏生姜。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"单味生半夏、生姜，这两个药放在一起的时候，叫小半夏汤。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"小半夏汤专门止呕去恶心。生半夏平常制过，半夏跟生姜煮在一起，因为生姜可以解半夏的毒，煮过以后，切片，烘干就是制半夏。制半夏其实就是生半夏跟生姜混合的东西。但是炮制过跟生用，炮制过以后就不用加生姜了，比如止呕，没有生半夏，用制半夏就不用加生姜了，如果用生半夏加生姜下去，生姜解生半夏的毒，可是你生用直接入汤剂的话，一剂下去恶心去掉，比制半夏治恶心力量强。"}]},{"ID":"20240312164454-xkydye2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312164454-xkydye2","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312164454"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"黄芩加半夏生姜汤方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312164454-3q8x2qs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312164454-3q8x2qs","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312164454"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"黄芩三两，芍药二两，甘草二两炙，大枣十二枚劈，半夏半升，生姜一两半（一本作三两）。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312164454-k0k8ntp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312164454-k0k8ntp","updated":"20240312164454"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"右六味,以水一斗,煮取三升,去滓,温服一升,日再服,夜一服。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312164454-hib5zoj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312164454-hib5zoj","updated":"20240312164454"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个处方有"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"下痢、有腹痛、恶心"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。什么时候用黄芩汤，什么时候用黄芩加半夏生姜汤，就是看恶心不恶心，这两个处方都有腹痛。葛芩连汤没有腹痛，就是下痢，病人热利怎么知道用葛芩连汤，什么时候用黄芩汤，热利大便很臭，肚子痛黄芩汤。还恶心黄芩汤加上生姜半夏。都不痛，葛芩连汤。从痛就可以确诊，不会错。止痢效果非常好，过去霍乱我们都会用到这些处方。"}]},{"ID":"20240312164503-71xwek1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312164503-71xwek1"}},{"ID":"20240312164504-gq0tj0l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312164504-gq0tj0l","updated":"20240312164504"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第三百四十七条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312164504-q2cgycx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312164504-q2cgycx","updated":"20240312164504"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：「伤寒」：脉迟，六七日，而反与「黄芩汤」彻其热。脉迟为寒，今与「黄芩汤」，复除其热，腹中应冷，当不能食，今反能食，此为「除中」，必死。"}]},{"ID":"20240312164504-pensuu9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312164504-pensuu9","updated":"20240312164504"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"伤寒，脉浮数的时候，是表症，会发表。病人现在是恶寒，很冷，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"脉是迟的，里寒"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，药开错了，开了寒凉的药，「黄芩汤」是寒凉的药，寒上加寒，再把里面的药去掉，这个时候肚子里面应该是冷的，应该是不能食，因为他里面"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"本来是冷的，又开寒凉的药，“今反能食，此为「除中」，必死”这就是回光返照"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，死症。他能吃东西，完全没有热的脉，脉是迟的，完全没有热的症状，这是回光返照。"}]}]}